+# Password hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use argon2id for password hashing. This was stated in an earlier project session and is kept in project memory as a session excerpt, not as a formal decision record, so it has not been confirmed beyond that statement. No parameters (memory cost, iterations, parallelism, salt length) are recorded, and none are specified here.
